      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "统治地位似乎是被人潮弄得头晕了。\n我在地图上搜索着，看有没有能让她安静休息的地方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "08ac87894349c2970594e46842f938e1934748872a42e866579623296833a59f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
